# The GiuliaGate campaign runs from this folder of the git clone on davinci
# (decided 2026-10-31). Nothing below is ever committed.
# Campaign output, the seed ledger and the launch logs:
/campaign_*/
/artifacts/
# The pipeline, copied from the clone's root folder in APPLY_GG.txt step 0 and
# patched in place (apply_freeze_patch.py, apply_prior_patch.py):
/HPC_main_sweep.py
/HPC_single_run.py
/ASD_fun_BD_cpp.py
/aggregate_sweep.py
/burst_metrics.py
/burst_plots.py
/synapse_pdist.csv
# Backups written by the patchers and by the line-ending fix:
*.bak-*
*.crlf_bak
# Never run "git clean -x" in the clone: it deletes ignored files, so the
# pipeline copies and every campaign above.
